<title>USA: Oilex sees annual revenues of $12.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Oilex sees annual revenues of $12.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oilex Inc said Friday it anticipates 1997 revenues of $12.5 million.</p>
<p>Revenues for 1996 were negligible, the company said.</p>
<p>Oilex said its audit is in progress and expected to be finalized over the next 30 days.  Once it has been finalized, the company will take the necessary steps to attempt to get listed on Nasdaq, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
